<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/san-chen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6908163); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6908163&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608968326" alt="San Chen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6908163)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/san-chen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6908163); return false;">San Chen</a></span></p>
